<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Keep us in your prayers | The Holy Quran</title>
<meta name="description" content="Aicha Abdellah's site for listening to the complete Holy Quran, recited by leading Qaris Remember us in your Duas; may Allah gather us in this world and the Hereafter">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
